OL,3,GNEWSAClassic tractor to be auctioned to
OL,4,Athank hospital
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has donated his cherished classic
OL,7,Ftractor to be auctioned to thank a
OL,8,Fhospital for saving his son's life.
OL,10,FEd Burdge, now 20, underwent a heart
OL,11,Ftransplant operation at Royal Papworth
OL,12,FHospital in Cambridge, when he was 17.
OL,14,FNow fully recovered, his father Michael
OL,15,FBurdge, from Bristol, has donated his
OL,16,F1991 Ford 7810 Silver Jubilee model
OL,17,Ftractor to Cambridge auctioneer
OL,18,FCheffins to raise funds to improve
OL,19,Ffacilities for the hospital's patients
OL,20,Fand their visitors.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
